{
  "id": "ep184",
  "duration": 54.879,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 5.758,
      "text": "In 1983, Soviet satellites reported an incoming American nuclear strike.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Pershing II PC022206C.png",
        "credit": "United States Army",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pershing_II_PC022206C.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.233,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 3.233,
          "end": 5.767,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 5.758,
      "end": 12.978,
      "text": "On September 26, early-warning screens alerted duty officer Stanislav Petrov to five missiles.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "2023 Warszawa Ogr\u00f3d Sprawiedliwych, Stanis\u0142aw Jewgrafowicz Pietrow.jpg",
        "credit": "Cybularny",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2023_Warszawa_Ogr%C3%B3d_Sprawiedliwych,_Stanis%C5%82aw_Jewgrafowicz_Pietrow.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 5.767,
          "end": 10.133,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 10.133,
          "end": 12.967,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 12.978,
      "end": 19.998,
      "text": "With impact minutes away, automated military computers registered the threat at highest reliability.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Minuteman III launch (4333697).jpg",
        "credit": "U.S. Air Force photo by Jose Davila",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Minuteman_III_launch_(4333697).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 12.967,
          "end": 16.467,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.467,
          "end": 20.0,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 19.998,
      "end": 26.818,
      "text": "Yet Petrov reasoned a real first strike would be an overwhelming barrage, not five isolated launches.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Pershing II - 4th test launch.jpeg",
        "credit": "DoD",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pershing_II_-_4th_test_launch.jpeg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 20.0,
          "end": 22.833,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 22.833,
          "end": 26.833,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 26.818,
      "end": 31.963,
      "text": "Ground radar showed clear skies over the horizon, confirming his suspicion.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "DUGA Radar Array near Chernobyl, Ukraine 2014.jpg",
        "credit": "Ingmar Runge",
        "license": "CC BY 3.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DUGA_Radar_Array_near_Chernobyl,_Ukraine_2014.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 26.833,
          "end": 28.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 28.867,
          "end": 31.967,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 31.963,
      "end": 39.033,
      "text": "Petrov decided against reporting an attack, notifying headquarters instead that the system had malfunctioned.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "DUGA Radar Array near Chernobyl, Ukraine 2014.jpg",
        "credit": "Ingmar Runge",
        "license": "CC BY 3.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DUGA_Radar_Array_near_Chernobyl,_Ukraine_2014.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 31.967,
          "end": 39.033,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 39.033,
      "end": 45.883,
      "text": "Investigations later revealed the satellite had encountered a rare orbital alignment with the Sun.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "CNX UPhysics 11 03 Molniya img.png",
        "credit": "OpenStax University Physics",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CNX_UPhysics_11_03_Molniya_img.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 39.033,
          "end": 45.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 45.883,
      "end": 51.053,
      "text": "Sensors mistook bright reflection off high-altitude clouds for rocket flames.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "ISS031-E-121142 - View of Earth.jpg",
        "credit": "Earth Science and Remote Sensing Unit, Lyndon B. Johnson Space Center",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ISS031-E-121142_-_View_of_Earth.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 45.867,
          "end": 48.333,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 48.333,
          "end": 51.067,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 51.053,
      "end": 54.529,
      "text": "Cloud-reflected sunlight nearly started World War Three.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Pershing II PC022206C.png",
        "credit": "United States Army",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pershing_II_PC022206C.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 51.067,
          "end": 54.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
